<p><strong>Original Source</strong>: <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Playboy_Bunny.jpg">https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Playboy_Bunny.jpg</a><br />
<strong>Creator</strong>: Psychonaught</p>
<p>Original work was released into the public domain.</p>
<p>The final image, the post-it note, is mine, but I hereby release it into the public domain as well, for what it's worth.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Notes</a></div>
