<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Obviously, this SCP owes a lot to <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-3929">SCP-3929</a>. It also comes from my own struggles with migraines (no joke, I got a migraine while writing it) and from one thing that always puzzled me about dado: Who is recommending dado to these people who end up with disastrous pharmaceuticals from him?</p>
</div>
